            "claim": "**Multimodality.** Human demonstrations can contain several valid action strategies. <Term id=\"diffusion-policy\">Diffusion Policy</Term> models multimodal action distributions: in its Push-T example it learns both modes, left-going and right-going, and commits to one mode within a rollout <Cite id=\"diffusion-policy-2023\" />.",
