                  "supportingPassage": "Get dataset 𝒟i={(s,π∗​(s))}\\\\mathcal{D}\\_{i}=\\\\{(s,\\\\pi^{\\*}(s))\\\\} of visited states by πi\\\\pi\\_{i} and actions given by expert."
