            "note": "ACT-FIVE-SOURCE-22-20260907. Exact old/current tuple and prior P1 archived below. Zero new source requests; original web fetch response events on 7 September 2026 are retained in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/act-five-source-records-integration/source-proof.json. Source-specific settings, editions and availability limitations travel with the current claim. No source-ready part is independent acceptance.",
