            "claim": "<Cite id=\"pi06-model-card-2025\" /> The November 17, 2025 π0.6 model card describes a continuous-action flow-matching expert; FAST tokens supervise the VLM backbone during training. The card does not specify predicted or executed chunk length, robot-control rate, or model-specific weight-release and licensing terms. Its 63 ms action-chunk latency uses five denoising steps and three camera inputs on one H100; this is inference latency, not a control frequency. The card’s openpi release statement concerns the π0.5 comparator, not π0.6.",
