            "note": "ACT-FINAL-PAPER-27-20260907. Original/current tuple and prior P1 archived below. Zero new fetches. Reused original official PDF HTTP200/no-redirect retrievals begun 2026-09-07T16:28:10.810822Z (pi06) and 16:28:11.862371Z (pi07), with separate binary and derived-text hashes and conversion warnings. Literal byte-verified source text and provenance: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/act-final-model-paper-corrections/source-proof.json. Whole corrected claim is source-scoped; unknown availability is not closed licensing, inference latency is not control Hz, and discrete execution choices do not imply a robot assignment.",
            "compound": {
