            "note": "VLA-GENERALIST-CLOSEOUT-vla-models-15. OpenVLA uses Prismatic/Llama2 with DINOv2+SigLIP,970k demonstrations, seven action coordinates and256 quantile-bounded bins,1st–99th rather than minima/maxima. Its29-task comparison means17WidowX×10 and12Google×5 with matched initial conditions and partial credit where defined.16.5percentage points and authors’7x wording remain setup-specific.6Hz4090 inference is not universal control. Toy[-1,1]/16steps/synthetic tokens remain labelled; every exact bin center reconstructs with zero error. Retained-source review 2026-09-08T03:08:28.103Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual9764820. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-vla-generalist-closeouts-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-vla-generalist-closeouts-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
