            "claim": "FAST improves learning over naïve binning in the evaluated 20Hz bussing and 50Hz shirt-folding setups. It uses normalized per-dimension temporal DCT, coefficient quantization and BPE. FAST+ uses approximately one million one-second action chunks. The 10k-hour generalist comparison matches pi0 task performance with five times fewer GPU hours (abstract: up to 5x).",
