            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-pi-line-10-20260907. FAST reports approximately 750 ms versus within 100 ms on 4090 for one-second chunks and typically 30–60 autoregressive tokens versus ten diffusion steps. The KI note reports twice the time for the specialist bussing task. These are separate quantities and comparison populations, not one twofold inference ratio. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
