                  "supportingPassage": "![Refer to caption](https://arxiv.org/html/2505.23705v1/figures/vla_problems.jpg)Figure 2: Problems with standard VLA recipes. The robot is instructed to bus the spoon into the bin. π0\\\\pi\\_{0}\\[ [7](https://arxiv.org/html/2505.23705v1#bib.bib7 \"\")\\] (left) ignores the command and grasps a piece of trash instead. π0\\\\pi\\_{0}-FAST \\[ [37](https://arxiv.org/html/2505.23705v1#bib.bib37 \"\")\\] (middle) will eventually succeed but its inference time is very slow. Our recipe (right) solves the task, has fast inference, and the model converges very quickly to good performance (cf. Fig. [6(b)](https://arxiv.org/html/2505.23705v1#S6.F6.sf2 \"In Figure 6 ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ Knowledge Insulating Vision-Language-Action Models: Train Fast, Run Fast, Generalize Better\"))."
