                  "supportingPassage": "The model can now control the five-fingered, 22 degree-of-freedom SharpaWave hand on the Apollo 2 robot to complete delicate actions like tying knots or sealing a ziplock bag. It can also operate standard two-fingered parallel grippers on a Franka Duo platform to perform complex dexterous tasks (e.g. tight packing). We are continuing to advance the level of precision and speed to achieve human-level dexterity."
