                  "supportingPassage": "URL Content from: \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.07339\"\nTitle: [2506.07339] Real-Time Execution of Action Chunking Flow Policies\nStatus: 200\nMarkdown content:\n\n[Skip to main content](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.07339#content)\n\nSearch arXiv\n\nPress Enter to search · [Advanced search](https://arxiv.org/search/advanced)\n\n# Computer Science > Robotics\n\n**arXiv:2506.07339** (cs)\n\n\n\\[Submitted on 9 Jun 2025 ( [v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.07339v1)), last revised 5 Dec 2025 (this version, v2)\\]\n\n# Title:Real-Time Execution of Action Chunking Flow Policies\n\nAuthors: [Kevin Black](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Black,+K), [Manuel Y. Galliker](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Galliker,+M+Y), [Sergey Levine](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Levine,+S)\n\n"
