Yuheng Kuang](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Kuang,+Y), [Isabel Leal](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Leal,+I), [Lisa Lee](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lee,+L), [Tsang-Wei Edward Lee](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lee,+T+E), [Sergey Levine](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Levine,+S), [Yao Lu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lu,+Y), [Henryk Michalewski](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Michalewski,+H), [Igor Mordatch](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Mordatch,+I), [Karl Pertsch](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Pertsch,+K), [Kanishka Rao](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Rao,+K), [Krista Reymann](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Reymann,+K), [Michael Ryoo](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Ryoo,+M), [Grecia Salazar](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Salazar,+G), [Pannag Sanketi](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Sanketi,+P), [Pierre Sermanet](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Sermanet,+P), [Jaspiar Singh](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Singh,+J), [Anikait Singh](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Singh,+A), [Radu Soricut](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Soricut,+R), [Huong Tran](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Tran,+H), [Vincent Vanhoucke](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Vanhoucke,+V), [Quan Vuong](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Vuong,+Q), [Ayzaan Wahid](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Wahid,+A), [Stefan Welker](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Welker,+S), [Paul Wohlhart](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Wohlhart,+P), [Jialin Wu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Wu,+J), [Fei Xia](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xia,+F), [Ted Xiao](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xiao,+T), [Peng Xu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xu,+P), [Sichun Xu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xu,+S), [Tianhe Yu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Yu,+T), [Brianna Zitkovich](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Zitkovich,+B)\n\n[… noncontiguous retained passage …]\n\n## Submission history\n\nFrom: Brian Ichter \\[ [view email](https://arxiv.org/show-email/9e59d4f0/2307.15818)\\]\n\n**\\[v1\\]**\nFri, 28 Jul 2023 21:18:02 UTC (13,657 KB)\n\n"
