                  "sourceUrl": "https://www.figure.ai/news/helix-02",
                  "supportingPassage": "Each system operates at its natural timescale. **System 2 (S2)** reasons slowly about goals: interpreting scenes, understanding language, and sequencing behaviors. **System 1 (S1)** thinks fast, translating perception into full‑body joint targets at 200 Hz. **System 0 (S0)** executes at 1 kHz, handling balance, contact, and coordination across the entire body. Together, they form a tightly integrated hierarchy from pixels to torque.\n[Separate literal excerpt from the same retained response]\n**Architecture:** A 10M‑parameter neural network that takes full‑body joint state and base motion as input and outputs joint‑level actuator commands at 1 kHz."
