            "claim": "Hi Robot: separately trained PaliGemma-initialized high-level VLM and low-level pi0 VLA; images and open-ended language yield simpler commands for a low-level policy using images and robot state. High-level inference is triggered after one second or new text/transcribed-speech feedback, with user-signalled resumption. Human-labelled demonstrations and synthetic interactions train task-specific high levels, evaluated on table bussing, sandwich making and grocery shopping. Missing memory and low-level instruction/recovery failures remain; the Stat describes learned hierarchies, not one shared model.",
