            "note": "GO-HELIX-CROSS-TRANSFER-hierarchical-16. Reported pi0.5 action horizon50 and50Hz robot commands do not establish one inference per second. Preserve2000ms horizon, all cadence numbers and formulas as labelled schematic assumptions where not reported; instruction pulses are initial conditions, GO2 motor lane is not a third module. Retain GR1.5 Thinking VLA plus separate orchestrator and stage-specific Helix rates. Retained-source review 2026-09-08T01:58:37.794Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual950c190. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-go-helix-cross-transfer-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-go-helix-cross-transfer-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
