            "sourceChecked": "pistar06-2025: https://www.pi.website/download/pistar06.pdf; pistar06-blog-2025: https://www.pi.website/blog/pistar06",
            "note": "CROSS-CLOSEOUT-rl-finetuning-5-20260907. The report bounds quantitative comparisons by task, setup and baseline. Its90%+ summary excludes diverse laundry and does not make the box-stage chart a universal end-to-end result. The report13-hour and blog5:30am–11:30pm accounts remain separate, without an invented shared denominator or independent-replication claim. Retained-text review September 7, 2026; no new retrieval. Original retrieval events, editions and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-cross-article-closeouts-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Current binding is f1cf5aa; original/current cells and prior plans are preserved in the correction history below and validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-cross-article-closeouts-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Implementation authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance. Final composed reader/data input manifest SHA-256 0eccca3f96a17cc439a43db1d82f6302a40ffa50b7eeb90665611df4f88cc361: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-cross-article-closeouts-integration-20260907/final-product-inputs.json. Multiline Recap equations use proper display delimiters; old heading anchors remain; the source-leading RL chip fixes its measured horizontal overflow. Centered tooltip checks are bounded evidence, not an all-scroll-position pass. Final composed reader/data input manifest SHA-256 ca843c7aea1e0160d7216bd4a5776dd2439d740196addce7b09075110b94b075: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-cross-article-closeouts-integration-20260907/final-product-inputs-v2.json. Multiline Recap equations use proper display delimiters; old heading anchors remain; the source-leading RL chip fixes its measured horizontal overflow. Centered tooltip checks are bounded evidence, not an all-scroll-position pass.",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "cross-closeout-rl-finetuning-5-20260907",
