                  "supportingPassage": "\\[Submitted on 13 Dec 2024\\]\n\n# Title:RLDG: Robotic Generalist Policy Distillation via Reinforcement Learning\n\nAuthors: [Charles Xu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xu,+C), [Qiyang Li](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Li,+Q), [Jianlan Luo](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Luo,+J), [Sergey Levine](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Levine,+S)"
