                  "supportingPassage": "What to Ignore, What to React: Visually Robust RL\n                                                        Fine-Tuning of VLA Models\n\n\n                                                     Yuanfang Peng1,2 Jingjing Fu2 Chuheng Zhang2 Li Zhao2 Jiang Bian2\n                                                               Mingyu Liu3 Ling Zhang2∗ Jun Zhang1∗ Rui Wang2∗\n                                                                   1\n                                                                     Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\n                                                                              2\n                                                                                Microsoft Research Asia\narXiv:2605.13105v1 [cs.RO] 13 May 2026\n\n\n\n\n                                                                                 3\n                                                                                   Zhejiang University\n                                                                    ypengbx@connect.ust.hk, eejzhang@ust.hk\n                                                               {ds.dashu, jiang.bian.prc, wrui0920}@gmail.com\n                                                                {chuhengzhang, lizo, zhangling}@microsoft.com\n\n\n\n                                                                                           "
