                  "supportingPassage": "\\[Submitted on 1 Sep 2024 ( [v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.00588v1)), last revised 9 Dec 2024 (this version, v3)\\]\n\n# Title:Diffusion Policy Policy Optimization\n\nAuthors: [Allen Z. Ren](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Ren,+A+Z), [Justin Lidard](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lidard,+J), [Lars L. Ankile](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Ankile,+L+L), [Anthony Simeonov](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Simeonov,+A), [Pulkit Agrawal](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Agrawal,+P), [Anirudha Majumdar](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Majumdar,+A), [Benjamin Burchfiel](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Burchfiel,+B), [Hongkai Dai](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Dai,+H), [Max Simchowitz](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Simchowitz,+M)"
