                  "partId": "conrft-identity",
                  "citationId": "conrft-2025",
                  "sourceUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.05450",
                  "supportingPassage": "\\[Submitted on 8 Feb 2025 ( [v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.05450v1)), last revised 14 Apr 2025 (this version, v2)\\]\n\n# Title:ConRFT: A Reinforced Fine-tuning Method for VLA Models via Consistency Policy\n\nAuthors: [Yuhui Chen](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Chen,+Y), [Shuai Tian](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Tian,+S), [Shugao Liu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Liu,+S), [Yingting Zhou](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Zhou,+Y), [Haoran Li](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Li,+H), [Dongbin Zhao](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Zhao,+D)"
