                  "supportingPassage": "\\[Submitted on 30 Oct 2025\\]\n\n# Title:Self-Improving Vision-Language-Action Models with Data Generation via Residual RL\n\nAuthors: [Wenli Xiao](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xiao,+W), [Haotian Lin](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lin,+H), [Andy Peng](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Peng,+A), [Haoru Xue](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xue,+H), [Tairan He](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=He,+T), [Yuqi Xie](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Xie,+Y), [Fengyuan Hu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Hu,+F), [Jimmy Wu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Wu,+J), [Zhengyi Luo](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Luo,+Z), [Linxi \"Jim\" Fan](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Fan,+L+%22), [Guanya Shi](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Shi,+G), [Yuke Zhu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Zhu,+Y)"
