            "sourceChecked": "vla-perf-2026: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.18397",
            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-realtime-execution-3. The B100 sweep distinguishes action-expert latency from total VLA latency: 10→50 steps is 5× versus 2.15×, while chunk50→250 is40% versus11%. The roofline model is not a five-GPU profiling campaign or evidence of field-wide priorities. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.041Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "performance-worldmodels-realtime-execution-3-20260908",
