            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-realtime-execution-5. Ten and100Hz are the study’s chosen inference targets, not universal robot-control requirements. On-device19Hz exceeds the former; model-size/steps/precision are proposed levers, not demonstrated accuracy-preserving quantization gains. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.101Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
