            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-realtime-execution-15. Four separately cited source settings remain distinct from teaching assumptions: VLA-Perf roofline predictions, RTC measured mean totals, pi06’s63ms H100 chunk inference and pi07’s simulated240ms training delay. The3.0B/1.1B curve, five-tick blend and0.30 per-tick velocity discontinuity proxy preserve behavior without claiming RTC inpainting or physical jerk. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.205Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
