                  "supportingPassage": "While action chunking has enabled temporal consistency in high-frequency control tasks, it does not fully address the latency problem, leading to pauses or out-of-distribution jerky movements at chunk boundaries.\nThis paper presents a novel inference-time algorithm that enables smooth asynchronous execution of action chunking policies.\n"
