            "note": "GO-HELIX-CROSS-TRANSFER-cross-embodiment-3. Remove common pi0/Octo padding-and-normalization attribution and universal human-video impossibility. Octo standardized data interface and adaptable heads do not certify this original slot-layout toy. PI human/robot co-finetuning demonstrates a qualified transfer setting. Preserve32/3/8 widths, native slot counts, modes/default/reset and calculations; an empty toy row means no adapter modelled. Retained-source review 2026-09-08T01:58:37.879Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual950c190. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-go-helix-cross-transfer-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-go-helix-cross-transfer-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
