                  "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T",
                  "supportingPassage": "1. **Relative EEF Action Space** — N1.7 adopts a relative end-effector action space shared across robot and human embodiments. Representing actions as deltas from the current pose (rather than absolute targets) improves generalization and is a key factor in the model's cross-embodiment performance. See [`getting_started/finetune_new_embodiment.md`](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/blob/main/getting_started/finetune_new_embodiment.md) for guidance on configuring relative EEF for your own robot."
