            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-knowledge-insulation-2-20260907. The paper explicitly describes original pi0.5 as FAST training followed by expert post-training. The note names the new simultaneous single-stage model pi0.5 + KI. The current claim removes the field-wide/default-adoption inference and preserves distinct paper and note identities. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
