            "claim": "KI jointly trains a flow-matching expert and a backbone supervised by FAST actions plus vision-language/robot-planning data. FAST uses normalization, per-dimension temporal DCT, quantization and BPE. The expert reads the prefix, not FAST tokens; stopped backbone keys/values block expert gradients into the backbone.",
