            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-knowledge-insulation-5-20260907. The loss construction combines FAST, VLM and robot-planning data with flow matching. Equations 5 and 6 stop backbone keys and values. The attention mask excludes FAST/expert cross-attention in both directions. FAST scale-and-round is lossy; BPE compresses already-quantized integers losslessly. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "insulation-fast-dreamer-knowledge-insulation-5-20260907",
