            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-knowledge-insulation-6-20260907. The paper reports zero performance for the tested frozen-backbone shirt-folding configuration. It does not prove all frozen policies impossible. The explicit language-following section also reports good joint-training language following with VLM co-training and no stop-gradient; both the tested failure and counterexample remain visible. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
            "compound": {
