            "sourceChecked": "sac-2018: https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/1801.01290",
            "note": "Lane-B proposal RL-9-20260907; unapplied. Literal retained source passages and original retrieval event identities verified in retained-source-proof.json or rudin-source-proof.json. Original/current history must be preserved. No new successful retrieval. MANIP-RL-rl-for-robotics-9-20260907: same original ordinal; previous claim \"\\\"On-policy updates are the more stable and less hyperparameter-sensitive of the two\\\"\" and verdict \"**corrected**\" retained in non-counted history and validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-manipulation-rl-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Actual retained document text and original tool provenance verified at validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-manipulation-rl-integration-20260907/source-proof.json; review time is not a fetch date. September 7 owner correction authority is implementation permission, not human sentence certification. No whole-article/P1 or independent acceptance.",
