            "note": "Explicit cut of a universal, not verification of its truth or a claim that no such result exists. No smaller three-system assertion replaces the four-system claim. MANIP-RL-rl-for-robotics-14-20260907: same original ordinal; previous claim \"\\\"no serious real-robot training result uses an on-policy method to learn from scratch\\\"\" and verdict \"**corrected**\" retained in non-counted history and validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-manipulation-rl-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Actual retained document text and original tool provenance verified at validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-manipulation-rl-integration-20260907/source-proof.json; review time is not a fetch date. September 7 owner correction authority is implementation permission, not human sentence certification. No whole-article/P1 or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "manipulation-rl-rl-for-robotics-14-20260907",
