            "claim": "<Term id=\"hindsight-experience-replay\">Hindsight experience replay</Term> stores transitions under their original goal and selected alternative goals, recomputing the reward for each alternative. It is not restricted to failed episodes. The paper's simplest strategy uses the goal achieved in the final state; its **future** strategy instead samples goals achieved later in the same episode .",
