            "sourceChecked": "Hindsight Experience Replay; Marcin Andrychowicz, Filip Wolski, Alex Ray, Jonas Schneider, Rachel Fong, Peter Welinder, Bob McGrew, Josh Tobin, Pieter Abbeel, Wojciech Zaremba; 31st Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NIPS 2017); retained 1707.01495v3 full PDF at https://arxiv.org/pdf/1707.01495, actual HTTP 200 GET 2026-09-08T02:35:40.330175+00:00 to 2026-09-08T02:35:41.181405+00:00; derived text read in full including appendices. No fresh abstract-page status asserted.",
            "note": "Applied scoped source correction RL-CLOSEOUT-41-20260908. Exact retained source text and original retrieval events were reverified; this integration made zero source requests. All named part/citation/source-URL conjunctions are required. Current review is not a fetch. Evidence and original source proposals: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-rl-campaign-offline-her-integration-20260908/source-proof.json and normalized-inputs.json. No RL50/P1, date refresh, whole-article, release or independent acceptance. Original tuple (historical, not source proof): [\"\\\"Hindsight experience replay relabels a failed episode with the goal it actually reached\\\"\",\"Andrychowicz et al., NeurIPS 2017 PDF (arXiv 1707.01495), Sec. 1 + Sec. 3\",\"verified\",\"\\\"The pivotal idea behind HER is to replay each episode with a different goal than the one the agent was trying to achieve, e.g. one of the goals which was achieved in the episode.\\\"\"]. Immediate-before tuple at 669f942 (historical, not source proof): [\"\\\"Hindsight experience replay relabels a failed episode with the goal it actually reached\\\"\",\"Andrychowicz et al., NeurIPS 2017 PDF (arXiv 1707.01495), Sec. 1 + Sec. 3\",\"verified\",\"\\\"The pivotal idea behind HER is to replay each episode with a different goal than the one the agent was trying to achieve, e.g. one of the goals which was achieved in the episode.\\\"\"].",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "her-offline-comparison-rl-41-20260908",
