                  "supportingPassage": "# Title:The Ingredients of Real-World Robotic Reinforcement Learning\n\nAuthors: [Henry Zhu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Zhu,+H), [Justin Yu](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Yu,+J), [Abhishek Gupta](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Gupta,+A), [Dhruv Shah](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Shah,+D), [Kristian Hartikainen](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Hartikainen,+K), [Avi Singh](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Singh,+A), [Vikash Kumar](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Kumar,+V), [Sergey Levine](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Levine,+S)\n\nView a PDF of the paper titled The Ingredients of Real-World Robotic Reinforcement Learning, by Henry Zhu and 7 other authors"
