                  "supportingPassage": "[article h1] \"Reset-Free Reinforcement Learning via Multi-Task Learning: Learning Dexterous Manipulation Behaviors without Human Intervention\"\n\n[article .ltx_authors] \"Abhishek Gupta ∗ 1 Justin Yu ∗ 1 Tony Z. Zhao ∗ 1 Vikash Kumar ∗ 2 Aaron Rovinsky 1 Kelvin Xu 1 Thomas Devlin 1 Sergey Levine 1 1 UC Berkeley 2 University of Washington † † thanks: $ˆ*$Authors contributed equally to this work. † † thanks: ˜ https://sites.google.com/view/mtrf\""
