            "note": "Verbatim (Introduction): 'previous successes in dexterous manipulation involve much more laborious real-to-sim engineering efforts that are task-specific or hardware-specific'. Applied correction (singular 'effort' -> plural, qualifier added) confirmed against the fetched v1 body; the same sentence supplies the article's locomotion contrast ('While previous successes in RL-based locomotion ... are encouraging'). The sentence is absent from v2; the registry pins v1 and the live v1 pages confirm the quote.",
            "compound": {
