            "sourceChecked": "Isaac Lab v1, https://arxiv.org/html/2511.04831v1; exact per-part source text and locators retained in the native evidence plan",
            "note": "Current source-backed correction and retained-body review on 2026-09-08 by integrator review source-review integrator 18d95639; not independent acceptance. Original tuple (history, not proof): [\"\\\"DextrAH-RGB ... the first system to map stereo images directly to dexterous grasping end to end\\\"\",\"Isaac Lab paper, Sec. 5.1.2\",\"verified\",\"The authors' own first-system claim for DextrAH-RGB; attributed as such.\"]. Immediate-before tuple (history, not proof): [\"\\\"DextrAH-RGB ... the first system to map stereo images directly to dexterous grasping end to end\\\"\",\"Isaac Lab paper, Sec. 5.1.2\",\"verified\",\"The authors' own first-system claim for DextrAH-RGB; attributed as such.\"]. Producer GET 2026-09-08T00:55:54.021238+00:00 to 00:55:54.267675+00:00, observed 200/no redirects; body SHA256 9e3fba6a5031507b29d5ecc529c8dfba329f9f2c25582184b7d067f8aac43a39. Current review 2026-09-08T09:53:04.838899+00:00; no fresh fetch. Every required part/source pair, body context and original tool event checked in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-isaac-only-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Complete correction includes source-local reader, mounted CPU disclosure where applicable, and NVIDIA plus 105 unique Appendix A credits. Source-only proposal 9b042f2a5b203686db336935853db8780f9e179931de536244d66cf8156f54a1 reviewed rather than accepted prospectively. No whole-article P1/P5 certification or review-date bump.",
            "compound": {
              "planId": "isaac-v1-rl-sim2real-why-rl-locomotion-6-20260908",
