            "note": "Verbatim: abstract 'We demonstrate zero-shot sim-to-real transfer, achieving 60% success on tight insertions with only 0.5 mm contact clearance'; 'finetuned in sparse-reward RL environments derived from CAD designs'; Table 1 Tight-Insertion 6/10 at 0.5 mm with 'no real-world finetuning'. Verified on v3 (8 Sep 2026), the current version at the registered URL. Training context: single RTX A6000, 7 days play pretraining + 1 day per-task finetuning.",
            "compound": {
