                  "sourceUrl": "https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2201.08117",
                  "supportingPassage": "# Learning robust perceptive locomotion for quadrupedal robots in the wildJournal: ol\n\nTakahiro Miki\nAffiliation: Robotic Systems Lab, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland\nAffiliation: Corresponding author: tamiki@ethz.ch\nJoonho Lee\nAffiliation: Robotic Systems Lab, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland\nJemin Hwangbo\nAffiliation: Robotics and Artificial Intelligence Lab, KAIST, Daejeon, Korea\nLorenz Wellhausen\nAffiliation: Robotic Systems Lab, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland\nVladlen Koltun\nAffiliation: Intelligent Systems Lab, Intel, Jackson, WY, USA.\nMarco Hutter\nAffiliation: Robotic Systems Lab, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland"
