          {
            "claim": "H2O performs real-time whole-body H1 teleoperation from RGB human-pose input, with robot-side MoCap linear velocity. It retargets AMASS human motion, filters it with a privileged imitator, and trains a separate domain-randomized policy issuing19 joint targets to PD. Naive retargeting can create infeasible references, not invariably destroy feasibility.",
            "line": 373,
