            "note": "Correction reviewed 2026-09-09T12:44:02.510Z by agent:0d32fee8/integrator against retained original responses, not a new retrieval. The evaluation section orders simulation benchmarks before the internal robustness fleet and describes thousands of simulated and on-robot hours before customer deployment. The fleet paragraph expressly calls over 2,000 hours a week cumulative runtime. The listed stairs, surfaces and weather describe testing conditions, not a per-robot duration or process start date. Only physics-simulation-reproducible issues are recreated; the text says either training or evaluation. The original training-only statement discarded an explicit alternative. Bibliography: Spot personal byline and RAI corporate-name expansion remain unestablished; the four explicit LBM Blog Authors are preserved despite JSON-LD mrodin. No whole-P1 or article credit. Original four cells are retained in boston-control-original-history-20260909. Source proof: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-boston-dynamics-control-integration-20260909/source-proof.json.",
