                  "supportingPassage": "TABLE I: Example of reward and cost definitions for the back-flip task.\nThe reward and cost functions are defined in the first five lines and the following five lines, respectively.\nIn the velocity reward, 𝟏turn\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\\\mathrm{turn}} means 11 if the robot completes a turn and 00 otherwise.\nIn the balance reward, z^B\\\\hat{z}\\_{B} and z^W\\\\hat{z}\\_{W} are the zz-axis unit vectors of the base and world frame, respectively.\nIn the style reward, qjdefaultq^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j} represents the default position of the jjth joint.\nIn the contact-related costs, ICspecifiedI\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{specified}} denotes the set of indices of specified links that make contact.\nDuring stages other than the jump stage, the foot contact cost outputs the predefined threshold value as the cost is undefined in these phases.\n\n|     |     |     |     |     |     |     |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| stage | stand | sit | jump | air | land | threshold |\n| reward functions |\n| base height | −\\|pz−0.35\\|-\\|p\\_{z}-0.35\\| | −\\|pz−0.2\\|-\\|p\\_{z}-0.2\\| | 𝟏pz≤0.5⋅pz\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{p\\_{z}\\\\leq 0.5}\\\\cdot p\\_{z} | 𝟏pz≤0.5⋅pz\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{p\\_{z}\\\\leq 0.5}\\\\cdot p\\_{z} | −\\|pz−0.35\\|-\\|p\\_{z}-0.35\\| | - |\n| base velocity | −(vx2+vy2+ωz2)-(v\\_{x}^{2}+v\\_{y}^{2}+\\\\omega\\_{z}^{2}) | −(vx2+vy2+ωz2)-(v\\_{x}^{2}+v\\_{y}^{2}+\\\\omega\\_{z}^{2}) | −𝟏turn⋅ωy-\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\\\mathrm{turn}}\\\\cdot\\\\omega\\_{y} | −s⋅ωy-s\\\\cdot\\\\omega\\_{y} | −(vx2+vy2+ωz2)-(v\\_{x}^{2}+v\\_{y}^{2}+\\\\omega\\_{z}^{2}) | - |\n| base balance | −∠⁡(z^B,z^W)-\\\\angle(\\\\hat{z}\\_{B},\\\\hat{z}\\_{W}) | −∠⁡(z^B,z^W)-\\\\angle(\\\\hat{z}\\_{B},\\\\hat{z}\\_{W}) | −\\|∠⁡(y^B,z^W)−π/2\\|-\\|\\\\angle(\\\\hat{y}\\_{B},\\\\hat{z}\\_{W})-\\\\pi/2\\| | −\\|∠⁡(y^B,z^W)−π/2\\|-\\|\\\\angle(\\\\hat{y}\\_{B},\\\\hat{z}\\_{W})-\\\\pi/2\\| | −∠⁡(z^B,z^W)-\\\\angle(\\\\hat{z}\\_{B},\\\\hat{z}\\_{W}) | - |\n| energy | −∑jτj2-\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\tau\\_{j}^{2} | −∑jτj2-\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\tau\\_{j}^{2} | −∑jτj2-\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\tau\\_{j}^{2} | −∑jτj2-\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\tau\\_{j}^{2} | −∑jτj2-\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\tau\\_{j}^{2} | - |\n| style | −∑j(qj−qjdefault)2-\\\\sum\\_{j}(q\\_{j}-q^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j})^{2} | −∑j(qj−qjdefault)2-\\\\sum\\_{j}(q\\_{j}-q^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j})^{2} | −∑j(qj−qjdefault)2-\\\\sum\\_{j}(q\\_{j}-q^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j})^{2} | −∑j(qj−qjdefault)2-\\\\sum\\_{j}(q\\_{j}-q^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j})^{2} | −∑j(qj−qjdefault)2-\\\\sum\\_{j}(q\\_{j}-q^{\\\\mathrm{default}}\\_{j})^{2} | - |\n| cost functions |\n| foot contact | - | - | 𝟏\\|ICfoot,rear\\|=0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{foot,rear}}\\|=0} | - | - | 0.250.25 |\n| body contact | 𝟏\\|ICbody\\|>0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{body}}\\|>0} | 𝟏\\|ICbody\\|>0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{body}}\\|>0} | 𝟏\\|ICbody\\|>0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{body}}\\|>0} | 𝟏\\|ICbody\\|>0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{body}}\\|>0} | 𝟏\\|ICbody\\|>0\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|I\\_{C}^{\\\\mathrm{body}}\\|>0} | 0.0250.025 |\n| joint position | 1J∑j𝟏qj>qjmax\\|\\|qj<qjmin\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{q\\_{j}>q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}\\|\\|q\\_{j}<q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{min}}} | 1J∑j𝟏qj>qjmax\\|\\|qj<qjmin\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{q\\_{j}>q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}\\|\\|q\\_{j}<q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{min}}} | 1J∑j𝟏qj>qjmax\\|\\|qj<qjmin\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{q\\_{j}>q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}\\|\\|q\\_{j}<q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{min}}} | 1J∑j𝟏qj>qjmax\\|\\|qj<qjmin\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{q\\_{j}>q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}\\|\\|q\\_{j}<q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{min}}} | 1J∑j𝟏qj>qjmax\\|\\|qj<qjmin\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{q\\_{j}>q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}\\|\\|q\\_{j}<q\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{min}}} | 0.0250.025 |\n| joint velocity | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|q˙j\\|>q˙jmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}\\|>\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|q˙j\\|>q˙jmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}\\|>\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|q˙j\\|>q˙jmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}\\|>\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|q˙j\\|>q˙jmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}\\|>\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|q˙j\\|>q˙jmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}\\|>\\\\dot{q}\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 0.0250.025 |\n| joint torque | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|τj\\|>τjmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\tau\\_{j}\\|>\\\\tau\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|τj\\|>τjmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\tau\\_{j}\\|>\\\\tau\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|τj\\|>τjmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\tau\\_{j}\\|>\\\\tau\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|τj\\|>τjmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\tau\\_{j}\\|>\\\\tau\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 1J​∑j𝟏\\|τj\\|>τjmax\\\\frac{1}{J}\\\\sum\\_{j}\\\\mathbf{1}\\_{\\|\\\\tau\\_{j}\\|>\\\\tau\\_{j}^{\\\\mathrm{max}}} | 0.0250.025 |"
