            "note": "Correction reviewed 2026-09-09T14:08:44.644Z by agent:91cb126e/integrator against retained September 8 responses, not a new fetch. Equation 1 subtracts nonnegative penalty magnitudes. Equations 2–5 and the discussion support qualitative threshold-relative gain redistribution. No executable estimator, all-zero-ratio convention or new hyperparameter value is asserted. III-A1 reports an exploration-induced ROGER violation and comparatively successful tuned fixed gains. IV–V restrict claims to zero-penalty optimality and gentle dynamics. These counterpassages defeat a blanket safety or fixed-gain impossibility assertion; numerical inconsistencies and unseen appendix proofs remain excluded. The body prints June 21 2026 v2 and points outside itself for the appendix. RSS 2025 is arXiv journal-reference metadata, not a retrieved publisher record. Both source URLs and the two-author identity are retained. Full original/current cells: constrained-reward-original-history-20260909. Source provenance: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-constrained-reward-methods-integration-20260909/source-proof.json. No whole-P1/article, held-original or independent acceptance credit.",
