                  "supportingPassage": "arXiv:2606.01672v1 \\[cs.LG\\] 01 Jun 2026\n\n# Reward Design Agent for Reinforcement Learning\n\nHojoon Lee\nAjay Subramanian\nBen Abbatematteo\nVijay Veerabadran\nPedro Matias\nKarl Ridgeway\nNitin Kamra"
