                  "supportingPassage": "arXiv:2503.04613v3 \\[cs.RO\\] 06 Mar 2026\n\n# Whole-Body Model-Predictive Control of Legged Robots with MuJoCo\n\nJohn Z. Zhang\nAffiliation:  John Z. Zhang and Zachary Manchester are with the Department Aeronautics and Astronautics, Massachusetts Institute of Technology.\nTaylor A. Howell\nAffiliation: Taylor A. Howell, Tom Erez, and Yuval Tassa are with Google DeepMind.\nZeji Yi\nAffiliation: Zeji Yi, Chaoyi Pan, and Guannan Qu are with the Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Carnegie Mellon University.\nChaoyi Pan\nAffiliation: Zeji Yi, Chaoyi Pan, and Guannan Qu are with the Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Carnegie Mellon University.\nGuanya Shi\nAffiliation: Guanya Shi is with the Robotics Institute, Carnegie Mellon University.\nGuannan Qu\nAffiliation: Zeji Yi, Chaoyi Pan, and Guannan Qu are with the Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Carnegie Mellon University.\nTom Erez\nAffiliation: Taylor A. Howell, Tom Erez, and Yuval Tassa are with Google DeepMind.\nYuval Tassa\nAffiliation: Taylor A. Howell, Tom Erez, and Yuval Tassa are with Google DeepMind.\nZachary Manchester\n††thanks: This work was completed at Carnegie Mellon University.††thanks: Corresponding email: jzhang3@mit.eduAffiliation:  John Z. Zhang and Zachary Manchester are with the Department Aeronautics and Astronautics, Massachusetts Institute of Technology."
