            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-taxonomy-8-20260907. The revised claim explicitly describes V3, for which Nature and v2 specify both imagination training and the additional replay-buffer critic loss. The original Dreamer actor/critic claim remains separate and already complete; no V1 evidence is silently transplanted into V3. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
