            "note": "Applied JEPA-CLOSEOUT-15-20260908 against 9200c28. Retained full source bytes and original web fetch request/result records verified locally; zero new source requests. All current part/citation/source-URL pairs are required. validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-world-model-source-integration-20260908/jepa-event-binding.json records actual retrieval times separately from review. Source text and proposals: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-world-model-source-integration-20260908/source-proof.json and normalized-inputs.json. V-JEPA 2 body/abs author aliases and split-person metadata remain distinct; Table 4 77.3 and Table 14 76.5 are not silently reconciled. No JEPA14, taxonomy4/P1, review-date refresh, whole-article, release or independent acceptance. Original tuple (history, not source proof): [\"\\\"V-JEPA 2 pretrains action-free on over a million hours of internet video, then post-trains an action-conditioned predictor on less than 62 hours of unlabeled robot video from the Droid dataset, and plans zero-shot on Franka arms\\\"\",\"V-JEPA 2 paper\",\"verified\",\"1M hours; <62 h Droid; zero-shot Franka planning by embedding-distance search.\"]. Immediate-before tuple (history, not source proof): [\"\\\"V-JEPA 2 pretrains action-free on over a million hours of internet video, then post-trains an action-conditioned predictor on less than 62 hours of unlabeled robot video from the Droid dataset, and plans zero-shot on Franka arms\\\"\",\"V-JEPA 2 paper\",\"verified\",\"1M hours; <62 h Droid; zero-shot Franka planning by embedding-distance search.\"].",
