            "note": "Abstract prints verbatim: 'We present WorldVLA, an autoregressive action world model that unifies action and image understanding and generation.' and 'We demonstrate that WorldVLA outperforms standalone action and world models, highlighting the mutual enhancement between the world model and the action model.' Precision: 'interleaves' is the article's word, not the paper's (0 hits in the fetched full HTML); the paper's printed mechanism is three tokenizers (images, text, actions) sharing one vocabulary, unified within a single LLM architecture. No article-span change proposed.",
