            "note": "KI-FAST-DREAMER-latent-dynamics-5-20260907. Nature describes V3 recurrent h and stochastic z, softmax/categorical distributions, the encoder conditioned on h and observation, and the combined-state decoder/reward/continuation heads. The V3-specific categorical description is no longer sourced only to the original Dreamer paper. Actual retained-source review on September 7, 2026; original retrieval times and text hashes remain in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/source-proof.json. Source-only proposals were rebound to current e581a84 original cells. Previous claim/source/verdict/note and any former plans are preserved below and in validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-insulation-fast-dreamer-integration-20260907/row-history.json. Owner correction authority is implementation permission, not personal certification. Whole-article/P1 and independent acceptance remain incomplete.",
