            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-latent-dynamics-20. Fast-WAMv2 retains current-frame encoding through the video backbone and iterative action denoising while removing future-video generation. The190/810ms comparison is Fast-WAM/IDM on the stated5090D V2 towel-folding setup; no inferred controllerHz or universal superiority. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.255Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
