                  "sourceUrl": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.09985",
                  "supportingPassage": "Table 14 Effects of Long Training and cooldown. Results are reported at ViT-g model with cooldown at different resolutions.\n\n| Training Stage | IN1K | COIN | SSv2 | K400 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Phase 1(epoch800,no cooldown) | 83.8 | 89.1 | 75.1 | 85.8 |\n| Phase 2(annealed,256×256 resolution) | 84.6 | 90.7 | 75.3 | 86.6 |\n| Phase 2(annealed,384×384 resolution) | 85.1 | 90.2 | 76.5 | 87.3 |\n\n"
                },
                {
