            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-jepa-12. The unchanged peer fast-jepa-conjunction endpoint deletes the LeWorldModel causal-purpose and camp-concession attribution. The survey’s efficiency paragraph is a repeater’s characterization, not primary proof of that named model’s intent; deletion is not a factual disproof. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.348Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
