            "note": "PERFORMANCE-WORLDMODELS-jepa-13. The complete point6 replacement is limited to the Fast-WAM authors’ controlled comparisons. It removes both unsupported LeWorldModel intent and camp-wide concession, while retaining the video backbone/current-frame/action-denoising mechanism and bounded190/810ms setting. Retained-source review 2026-09-07T23:31:48.268Z; zero new retrievals. Rebound to actual89a31e5. Original retrieval status/time, literal contexts and hashes: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/source-proof.json. Exact prior/current tuple and plan archive: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-performance-worldmodels-integration-20260908/row-history.json and correction history below. Routine correction authority is not owner source certification or independent acceptance.",
            "compound": {
