                  "supportingPassage": "Figure 19: We can address the cultural bias of GPT-4 by prompting.\nAppendix D Cultural Bias\nCultural biases in Holodeck generation can stem from biases in the LLM and the 3D asset retrieval component. For example, in Figure 19 (left), when the prompt contains culturally specific terms such as “Japanese”, the generated scene may disproportionately feature prototypical objects like Manga posters. One mitigation strategy is to adjust the prompts, e.g., users can control the generation by simply adding a suffix like “no cultural bias” or making the prompt more detailed. This strategy is unlikely to fully remove bias, but these qualitative results suggest it can significantly help."
