            "claim": "RoboArena v2: seven universities using DROID Franka Panda; 612 A/B comparisons among seven DROID policies, distinct from 4,284 individual oracle rollouts. Evaluator policy identities are hidden. Task-aware rankings improve agreement with the authors’ oracle versus their specified conventional baseline, not universally; population and uncertainty limits remain explicit.",
