                  "supportingPassage": "OMPL aims to make it straightforward to evaluate new planning algorithms on realistic robots in realistic settings through integrations with libraries like VAMP and Pinocchio. Developers of new algorithms are encouraged to use OMPL's [benchmarking capabilities](https://ompl.kavrakilab.org/benchmark.html). Benchmark results can be explored interactively in [Planner Arena](https://plannerarena.org/), an external package like [Planner Developer Tools](https://robotic-esp.com/code/pdt/) or your own plotting tool!"
