            "note": "Support metric neighborhoods and progressive local feature summaries, not lossless pooling. FPS/radius/relative coordinates and density-adaptive MSG/MRG are explicit in sections 3.2-3.3. SSG density failure and geodesic-vs-Euclidean nonrigid limits are retained from sections 4.1-4.3. Preserve completed PointNet35 and couple MDX/glossary. Original four cells preserved in geometric correction history below. Exact source URLs, literal supporting text and all mandatory parts remain in the bound plan; provenance and byte/range checks: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-perception-geometric-integration-20260913/source-proof.json. Review is not retrieval or whole-article acceptance. Whole P1 remains open; no paper figures/video inspected.",
            "compound": {
