            "note": "The 52.5 AP result is Grounding DINO L/Swin-L on COCO 2017 validation, pretrained on O365, OpenImage and GoldG without COCO training images. Appendix B identifies O365v2 and GoldG constituents. O365 categories overlap COCO: dataset-zero-shot is not unseen-category proof. COCO-trained/fine-tuned rows are distinct. Historical four cells and original verdict retained in the 2026-09-13 perception-foundations correction history below. Exact retained passage/URL/byte bindings: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-perception-foundations-integration-20260913/source-proof.json. Targeted context review only; no whole-P1, source-visual, fresh liveness or release certification.",
