                  "supportingPassage": "Table 2: Zero-shot domain transfer and fine-tuning on COCO. \\* The results in brackets are trained with 1.5×\\\\times image sizes, i.e., with a maximum image size of 2000. †The models map a subset of O365 categories to COCO for zero-shot evaluations. ‡This is not a real zero-shot performance as we add COCO data during model training. We list the result here for a reference.\n\n|     |     |     |     |     |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Model | Backbone | Pre-Training Data | Zero-Shot | Fine-Tuning |\n| 2017val | 2017val/test-dev |\n| Faster R-CNN | RN50-FPN | - | - | 40.2 / - |\n| Faster R-CNN | RN101-FPN | - | - | 42.0 / - |\n| DyHead-T \\[ [5](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib5 \"\")\\] | Swin-T | - | - | 49.7 / - |\n| DyHead-L \\[ [5](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib5 \"\")\\] | Swin-L | - | - | 58.4 / 58.7 |\n| DyHead-L \\[ [5](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib5 \"\")\\] | Swin-L | O365,ImageNet21K | - | 60.3 / 60.6 |\n| SoftTeacher \\[ [50](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib50 \"\")\\] | Swin-L | O365,SS-COCO | - | 60.7 / 61.3 |\n| DINO(Swin-L) \\[ [57](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib57 \"\")\\] | Swin-L | O365 | - | 62.5 / - |\n| DyHead-T†\\[ [5](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib5 \"\")\\] | Swin-T | O365 | 43.6 | 53.3 / - |\n| GLIP-T (B) \\[ [25](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib25 \"\")\\] | Swin-T | O365 | 44.9 | 53.8 / - |\n| GLIP-T (C) \\[ [25](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib25 \"\")\\] | Swin-T | O365,GoldG | 46.7 | 55.1 / - |\n| GLIP-L \\[ [25](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib25 \"\")\\] | Swin-L | FourODs,GoldG,Cap24M | 49.8 | 60.8 / 61.0 |\n| DINO(Swin-T)†\\[ [57](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib57 \"\")\\] | Swin-T | O365 | 46.2 | 56.9 / - |\n| Grounding DINO T (Ours) | Swin-T | O365 | 46.7 | 56.9 / - |\n| Grounding DINO T (Ours) | Swin-T | O365,GoldG | 48.1 | 57.1 / - |\n| Grounding DINO T (Ours) | Swin-T | O365,GoldG,Cap4M | 48.4 | 57.2 / - |\n| Grounding DINO L (Ours) | Swin-L | O365,OI\\[ [19](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.05499#bib.bib19 \"\")\\],GoldG | 52.5 | 62.6 / 62.7 (63.0 / 63.0)\\* |\n| Grounding DINO L (Ours) | Swin-L | O365,OI,GoldG,Cap4M,COCO,RefC | 60.7‡ | 62.6 / - |\n\n"
