            "note": "Original four-cell tuple (JSON): [\"RoboGSim packages the same reconstruct-compose-evaluate loop\",\"robogsim-2024 (arXiv:2411.11839 abs: \\\"Gaussian Reconstructor, Digital Twins Builder, Scene Composer, and Interactive Engine\\\"; \\\"an online, reproducible, and safe evaluation for different manipulation policies\\\")\",\"V\",\"\"]. Original tuple SHA256: 91218162a672ee5013005785562b129609a0940c93c6b6c40dde0cf6d95fa320. Historical source label retained, not reused as proof. Source-auditor review 2026-09-08T17:39:48.346Z, session 3ae044fc. Four named components join multiview reconstruction and supplied MDH parameters with mesh assets and measured Isaac Sim alignment. Closed-loop action/physics/render feedback differs from replay and rendering quality. Ten trials allow three grasp attempts each. Preserve real-data placement 90% hardware versus 30% simulator and novel-scene table/prose disagreement. Retained unversioned body explicitly shows v2, 3 August 2025; 2024 remains initial-submission identity, not this revision date. Josef's September 7 'fix it all!' authorizes source-backed correction, not personal source certification, whole-article/P1 acceptance, date advancement or release acceptance. Retained-source proof: validation/brand-v2-editorial/source-recovery-20260906/convergence-scene-pointmaps-splats-costmaps-integration-20260908/source-proof.json; review is not a new fetch.",
            "compound": {
