            "note": "Source-backed correction; reviewed retained manuscript contexts on 2026-09-14, not a fresh retrieval or whole-article/P1 acceptance. All required parts and their named sources are conjunctive. Original four-cell tuple (JSON): {\"claim\":\"ORB-SLAM3 adds visual-inertial operation and multiple maps, so a session that loses tracking starts a new map and merges it back when the place is recognised again\",\"sourceChecked\":\"orb-slam3-2021 (arXiv:2007.11898 abs, verbatim: \\\"when it gets lost, it starts a new map that will be seamlessly merged with previous maps when revisiting mapped areas\\\")\",\"verdict\":\"V\",\"note\":\"\"}. Historical/current/proposed cells and exact source provenance are retained in the non-counted correction history. Historical abstract two-to-five/3.6 cm and retained v2 body two-to-ten/3.5 cm are not collapsed; neither numerical result is claimed.",
            "compound": {
