            "claim": "Square Root SAM jointly estimates the trajectory and landmark map by maximum a posteriori (MAP) inference. Under Gaussian process and measurement models with known data associations, this becomes a nonlinear least-squares problem. With the reference frame fixed, nonlinear optimisation solves successive sparse linearised systems using QR of the measurement Jacobian or Cholesky of the information matrix; variable ordering controls fill-in.",
