                  "supportingPassage": "# Title:Tactile Robotics: An Outlook\n\nAuthors: [Shan Luo](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Luo,+S), [Nathan F. Lepora](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Lepora,+N+F), [Wenzhen Yuan](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Yuan,+W), [Kaspar Althoefer](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Althoefer,+K), [Gordon Cheng](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Cheng,+G), [Ravinder Dahiya](https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&query=Dahiya,+R)"
