            "claim": "Brooks’s 2019 CNN-front-end argument and his 2025 speech account concern engineered inputs: his speech account lists FFTs and Mel filter banks among telephone-derived preprocessing techniques, with selections varying by implementation; he also credits leaving as much as possible to learning for speech and image gains.",
