                  "sourceUrl": "https://www.bvp.com/atlas/bessemer-predicts-robotics-and-physical-ai",
                  "supportingPassage": "At Bessemer, we often invest in new categories when we see the intersection of three forces: talent migration, technology breakthroughs, and structural tailwinds. In robotics and physical AI, all three are accelerating simultaneously. Already, we’ve invested in breakthrough teams, as our portfolio spans software, full systems, and foundation models: [Waymo](https://www.bvp.com/news/waymo-drives-the-next-chapter-of-autonomous-mobility), [Mind Robotics](https://www.mindrobotics.com/), [Foxglove](https://foxglove.dev/), [Breaker](https://breakerindustries.com/), [Noda](https://www.bvp.com/news/noda-ai-building-the-future-of-operational-collaborative-autonomy-at-the-frontlines), [Voxel51](https://www.bvp.com/news/powering-the-ai-data-workflow-with-voxel51), [DroneDeploy](https://www.dronedeploy.com/), [Auterion](https://www.bvp.com/news/the-future-of-defense-is-software-defined-autonomy-our-investment-in-auterion), [Perceptron](http://perceptron.inc/), and [ANYbotics](https://www.anybotics.com/). But we're just getting started, especially after identifying the [top 50 startups](https://www.bvp.com/atlas/50-startups-transforming-industries-with-physical-ai) building in the space. **Below are the six predictions shaping our investment activity in 2026—and the founder perspectives that are shaping how we see what’s on the horizon.**\n\nBut two hard questions remain unanswered: how much more data, and what kinds, will be needed to close the gap between lab performance and the 99.9% reliability threshold that production deployment demands? And what does the ChatGPT moment for robotics actually look like when it arrives?\n\nDisclaimer:The information presented here is for general informational and educational purposes only and does not constitute investment advice, a recommendation, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any securities or investment products. Certain companies discussed may be current or former portfolio companies of Bessemer Venture Partners. Past performance is not indicative of future results. All investments involve risk, including possible loss of principal."
