            "note": "Free public research literature confirms the categories exist in that standard: \"recall that **IEC 60204-1** outlines **three stopping categories** based on the removal of power, application of brakes, and control of the equipment during the braking function.\" IEC 60204-1's own catalogue abstract independently confirms Clause 9 covers \"safe torque off of PDS, emergency stop, and control circuit protection\". Normative text not fetched",
