                  "supportingPassage": "Level 0: No autonomy. This level includes tele-operated robots or prosthetic devices that respond to and follow the user's command. A surgical robot with motion scaling also fits this category because the output represents the surgeon's desired motion."
                },
                {
                  "partId": "sg6-practicing-medicine",
